      "page": "73",
      "loc": "para",
      "section": "Sample Agenda for 3-Day Workshop",
      "en": "It focuses on using the MSP as a tool to strengthen MHPSS programming, including integrating MHPSS into humanitarian programming and supporting non-specialists to implement MHPSS activities.",
      "ne": "यसले MHPSS कार्यक्रम तर्जुमा तथा कार्यान्वयन सुदृढ गर्ने साधनका रूपमा MSP प्रयोग गर्नमा जोड दिन्छ। यसमा मानवीय कार्यक्रम तर्जुमा तथा कार्यान्वयनमा MHPSS एकीकृत गर्ने र विशेषज्ञ नभएका व्यक्तिहरूलाई MHPSS गतिविधिहरू कार्यान्वयन गर्न सहयोग गर्ने कार्य समावेश छन्।",
      "bt": "It emphasizes using the MSP as a tool to strengthen MHPSS programme formulation and implementation. This includes integrating MHPSS into humanitarian programme formulation and implementation and supporting people who are not specialists to implement MHPSS activities.",
